{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女團HUR+近來各自發展，團員C.Holly跟DJ SODA合唱新歌《花心大蘿蔔》，今合體辦記者會宣傳，大方分享遇到渣男的經驗。DJ SODA說跟初戀交往2年期間，因為對方酒後常常動粗，像是毆打她、摔破酒瓶攻擊，導致她左手臂內側留有5 厘米傷疤，令人怵目驚心。</p><p>C.Holly、DJ SODA同為白羊座，感情經歷同樣悽慘，C.Holly笑稱自己喜歡流氓，仰賴己身經驗寫出《花心大蘿蔔》，她解釋「過程是痛並快樂著」，把重點擺在愉快回憶上面。只是DJ SODA頻頻遇到渣男，前男友當時一口氣劈腿6個女生，還曾因感情事件鬧到警局：</p><blockquote><p>我們在一起約3個月，知道他劈腿就立刻分手。</p></blockquote><p>HUR+成員C.Holly頻與DJ SODA合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》▼▼▼</p><figure><img alt=\"近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188112985571463168349725.jpeg/o0HlB2EYpt1GqPT9YF0q-lzHnsl77tBifBPHDnwTxw4\"/><figcaption>近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188112980932300800590361.jpeg/at5lYvvHpBBn6Ic586GJsq2pjLe32JnuPyp2Tz8qdk8\"/><figcaption>近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114100761530368487130.jpeg/VtBLE1k3C-ZHs54E55N42acGtfkV3noT2T19rtk9fa4\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114100908331008674503.jpeg/Rnx6yHLog0iFlOpYMUdP0Xe1FOUd_zVWhv_cdob_3HY\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114098320314368760528.jpeg/8GzHxgC4tFauZg4Eqohbp_qvXPWW8TAYx_md6Mf5neg\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114098693607424392014.jpeg/hK8LHha1PzGx-YJS9iRRZ__g9pXcYdaXZyFyfWchcn0\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114096315305984908672.jpeg/9b59EEhN01-z22kEAqjBm39zF717UGJuO45K2zuOSts\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114095581302784215894.jpeg/Q8B_RmHZyxdP1LpEgRaAQk8R_2FmX7pTFFweghRcHoI\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114097951215616539106.jpeg/9RwotwzGL7Utu9LxSzoAxMiyWQhHcJP2HdaQ5x3WkOc\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114100551815168849357.jpeg/_0pMMEACURoOJyLUwkjzVMBBDsRaYmV_4MxcdeDMXHU\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114093626626048732091.jpeg/yzjr6jMALrswK49WbV3gbj5uIWYrMpY2p66xIaeusSE\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114091403644928623075.jpeg/8m1st22JpnK0qiZOKoVr60ZYtK_BvkhGb6yB3W-sgd0\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114095992344576490683.jpeg/GXGEb_khMN4WYKxgxlFF4YWUtA3k6JY3sTdjTrE3Y04\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114102590377984418560.jpeg/_CWd-R6hL1BD1nV_HzQapQwvenTCBFpYdgIqIHYCKiA\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114093173641216598412.jpeg/8kKLLSAQvJdQ4JhiI23u1qVmxPTmkti1oJnXh6CZ14c\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114098320314368453961.jpeg/z4SS5mIUL3hkr6v6mN1ADI_k-y2E2_-K4hevZuIXr2Y\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188114093572100096071864.jpeg/VEU6lzy4YyBKePkVDzREYkVzaO-5Z54sVkOISFZDiEg\"/><figcaption>HUR+成員C.Holly X DJ SODA《花心大蘿蔔》MV截圖</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188112987995901952147268.jpeg/yqCdiiMxXEJex64A0A7mLYt_ykz8yuHNWPPXJFjz1yQ\"/><figcaption>近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188112983310602240730285.jpeg/EbVARlRiSuYoJ4Pt7Pmo0OenZUN0aHujucSF_rnEhf4\"/><figcaption>近期女團HUR+成員C.Holly跟DJ SODA頻合體宣傳新歌《花心大蘿蔔》。（IG@c.holly.com_）</figcaption></figure><p>講起這段過往，DJ SODA仍憤恨不平，表示前男友是很有名的籃球選手，原本以為他跟舊愛已經分開，經友人告知才得知是重疊交往，含自己在內共有7名女性受害，決定組成「婦仇者聯盟」，她說：</p><blockquote><p>我們一起成立群組，然後把男生拉進來痛罵。</p></blockquote><p>而她15年前跟知名韓國Rapper交往，未料初戀竟是雙面人，「他不喝酒是天使，但一喝酒就會打人，有次砸碎酒瓶攻擊我」，當場血流不止，幸而沒有傷到動脈。</p><p>接連遇到數位渣男，DJ SODA坦言留有陰影，現在變得不相信男生，有考慮跟女生交往嗎？她連忙搖頭「沒有喜歡過女生」，想透過歌曲以及自己的經驗告誡女性：</p><blockquote><p>謹慎交友、謹慎暈船。</p></blockquote><p>更多韓國女神DJ SODA照片▼▼▼</p><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250601/1005793875149066240652819.jpeg/TqvqVlk_LEG9MubAYxgXh1dpgtdIkLG2zaKK0M2iitA\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026447462011244544174360.png/4Qsf-7KgZy490uipC6BhZzdGDJn5HkbmFoW86BaFvOg\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250601/1005793877900660736481507.jpeg/IeWvP0Dzc13moXPZppTo0JKBxmaMfCSL0zCcddMwnHU\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240827/905070607392575488819732.jpeg/ni223y9At-Mq_7zHpbkE6_thqUeo6VD8HBUqbhwVKm4\"/><figcaption>DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250601/1005793867594731520021389.jpeg/ZNFMiJWoam0vh-2wZHzq93MvllHeoP5atzf5Pbc3-T0\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250720/1023664906320220160127958.png/kY8w2p2Mqk2hx6DLtNsQPCWf77abElkakqQeH5KkHh8\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026447457913147392368504.png/9I9p3mUOzivbRG8esFG_jYPxSlI6KvBInodWLJ6HViw\"/><figcaption>DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240827/905070601843511296506914.jpeg/cpOpvUKAP8-ZMkgSj7rBvxT_S474uOoEbydeEG8nXhA\"/><figcaption>DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240827/905070598005198848802634.jpeg/Jmi7TBDcuI-mFPF3riGrvKPTGmmAatfGKjj1vSo49b0\"/><figcaption>DJ Soda（IG@deejaysoda）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"DJ SODA（IG@deejaysoda）\" src=\"ht